<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Game Dev Discovery & Assessment Simulator</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            background-color: #0b0f19;
            color: #e2e8f0;
        }
        .code-font {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
        }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #111827;
        }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #374151;
            border-radius: 3px;
        }
        .glow-effect {
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px -5px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.25);
        }
        .glass-card {
            background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.7);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }
        .pulse-subtle {
            animation: pulse 3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.6, 1) infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.6; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between custom-scrollbar bg-slate-950 text-slate-100">

    <!-- Header Navigation -->
    <header class="border-b border-slate-800 glass-card sticky top-0 z-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-indigo-600 to-violet-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white text-xl shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/30">
                    <i class="fa-solid font-gamepad fa-gamepad"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="font-extrabold text-lg tracking-tight bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-slate-200 to-indigo-400">
                        SIMULADOR DE DISEÑO DE VIDEOJUEGOS
                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-xs text-indigo-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">Evaluación Práctica (30% Calificación)</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Header Status Info -->
            <div id="header-status" class="hidden sm:flex items-center space-x-6 text-xs">
                <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg flex items-center space-x-2">
                    <span class="text-slate-400">Cliente Activo:</span>
                    <span id="header-client-name" class="font-bold text-indigo-300">Cargando...</span>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg flex items-center space-x-2">
                    <span class="text-slate-400">Fase:</span>
                    <span id="header-step-name" class="font-bold text-emerald-400">01. Briefing</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Container -->
    <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 flex-grow w-full">

        <!-- STEP 0: WELCOME & BRIEFING -->
        <section id="step-0" class="space-y-8 transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-10 border border-slate-800 glow-effect relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute -right-16 -bottom-16 w-64 h-64 bg-indigo-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

                <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-6">
                    <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 text-xs font-semibold">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase"></i>
                        <span>Simulación Práctica de la Industria</span>
                    </div>

                    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
                        Simulador de Kickoff: Creación & Validación de Game Concept
                    </h2>

                    <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-base">
                        Estimado/a Diseñador/a de Videojuegos, has sido contratado por una firma inversora para liderar el proceso de conceptualización de un nuevo título estratégico. 
                        El cliente te presentará una visión de negocio. Tu misión es tomar sus ideas y aplicar herramientas profesionales: 
                        <strong class="text-indigo-400">Bartle Player Types</strong>, el <strong class="text-indigo-400">Gamification Model Canvas</strong> y el <strong class="text-indigo-400">One Page Game Design Document (GDD)</strong>.
                    </p>

                    <!-- Student Metadata Form -->
                    <div class="bg-slate-900/80 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 space-y-4">
                        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-200 uppercase tracking-wider">Datos del Evaluado</h3>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                            <div>
                                <label class="block text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1">Nombre Completo del Alumno</label>
                                <input type="text" id="student-name" placeholder="Ej. Ana María Torres" class="w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500 transition">
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <label class="block text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1">Matrícula / Código</label>
                                <input type="text" id="student-id" placeholder="Ej. A01234567" class="w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500 transition">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
                        <button onclick="startSimulation()" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-violet-600 hover:from-indigo-500 hover:to-violet-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/30 transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex items-center justify-center space-x-3">
                            <span>Generar Encargo del Cliente (Aleatorio)</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-dice"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- STEP 1: CLIENT BRIEFING & ANALYSIS -->
        <section id="step-1" class="hidden space-y-6">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <!-- Client Card -->
                <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-800 space-y-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div class="space-y-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-4">
                            <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-400">Cliente Asignado</span>
                            <span id="client-badge" class="px-2 py-1 bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-300 text-xs rounded font-mono">ID-GAME</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                            <img id="client-avatar" src="" alt="Client Avatar" class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 object-cover">
                            <div>
                                <h3 id="client-name" class="font-bold text-white text-lg">Nombre del Cliente</h3>
                                <p id="client-role" class="text-xs text-slate-400">Productor Ejecutivo</p>
                                <p id="client-company" class="text-xs text-indigo-400">Estudio / Publisher</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-slate-900/90 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
                            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider"><i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left mr-2 text-indigo-400"></i>Petición del Cliente</h4>
                            <p id="client-pitch" class="text-sm text-slate-300 italic leading-relaxed">
                                Pitch del cliente...
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-indigo-950/40 p-4 rounded-xl border border-indigo-900/50 space-y-2">
                        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-300 flex items-center">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb mr-2 text-amber-400"></i> Retro-Informativa
                        </h4>
                        <p id="client-hint" class="text-xs text-slate-400">
                            Pista contextual para ayudar a estructurar la respuesta.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Analysis Form -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-2 glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-800 space-y-6">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-4">
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass-chart mr-2 text-indigo-400"></i> 1. Género, Mecánica Principal e Inmersión
                        </h3>
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Fase 1 de 4</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-4">
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-2">1.1 Género Principal del Videojuego</label>
                            <select id="input-genre" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500">
                                <option value="">Selecciona un género...</option>
                                <option value="Survival Horror">Survival Horror (Terror y Supervivencia)</option>
                                <option value="Metroidvania / Action Platformer">Metroidvania / Plataforma de Acción</option>
                                <option value="Sandbox / Survival Crafting">Sandbox / Construcción y Supervivencia</option>
                                <option value="Battle Royale / Shooter">Battle Royale / Shooter Multijugador</option>
                                <option value="Psychological Horror">Psychological Horror / Terror Psicológico</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-2">1.2 Definición de la Mecánica Core (Loop Principal)</label>
                            <textarea id="input-core-mechanic" rows="3" placeholder="Describe la acción principal que el jugador repite constantemente y cómo genera engagement..." class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500"></textarea>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-2">1.3 Tipo de Inmersión Predominante (Modelo de Salen & Zimmerman / Ernest Adams)</label>
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                                <label class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-3 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg cursor-pointer hover:border-slate-700">
                                    <input type="radio" name="immersion-type" value="Spatial / Tactical" class="mt-1 text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500">
                                    <div>
                                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-white block">Táctica / Espacial</span>
                                        <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 block">Basada en reflejos, dominio de controles, orientación espacial o ritmo de respuesta.</span>
                                    </div>
                                </label>
                                <label class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-3 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg cursor-pointer hover:border-slate-700">
                                    <input type="radio" name="immersion-type" value="Narrative / Emotional" class="mt-1 text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500">
                                    <div>
                                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-white block">Narrativa / Emocional</span>
                                        <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 block">Basada en la atmósfera, Lore, empatía con personajes y tensión psicológica.</span>
                                    </div>
                                </label>
                                <label class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-3 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg cursor-pointer hover:border-slate-700">
                                    <input type="radio" name="immersion-type" value="Systemic / Strategic" class="mt-1 text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500">
                                    <div>
                                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-white block">Sistémica / Estratégica</span>
                                        <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 block">Basada en la gestión de recursos, craft, optimización y mecánicas intrincadas.</span>
                                    </div>
                                </label>
                                <label class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-3 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg cursor-pointer hover:border-slate-700">
                                    <input type="radio" name="immersion-type" value="Social / Competitive" class="mt-1 text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500">
                                    <div>
                                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-white block">Social / Competitiva</span>
                                        <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 block">Basada en la interacción directa con otros jugadores, estatus y sincronización.</span>
                                    </div>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-2">1.4 Estructura Narrativa Propuesta</label>
                            <textarea id="input-narrative" rows="2" placeholder="Explica cómo se entrega la historia: emergente, explícita mediante cinemáticas, ambiental/medioambiental, etc..." class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500"></textarea>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex justify-end pt-4">
                        <button onclick="goToStep(2)" class="px-6 py-3 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl shadow-lg transition flex items-center space-x-2">
                            <span>Siguiente: Player Persona (Bartle)</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- STEP 2: PLAYER PERSONA (BARTLE MODEL) -->
        <section id="step-2" class="hidden space-y-6">
            <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-slate-800 space-y-6">
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-4 gap-4">
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-users-viewfinder mr-3 text-indigo-400"></i> 2. Definición del Player Persona & Taxonomía de Bartle
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Modela el perfil del jugador objetivo utilizando la taxonomía clásica de Richard Bartle.</p>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Fase 2 de 4</span>
                </div>

                <!-- Graphic Helper: Bartle Matrix -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 bg-slate-900/80 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                    <div class="p-3 bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 rounded-lg">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 block mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-trophy mr-1"></i> ACHIEVER (Triunfador)</span>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-300">Motivado por coleccionables, logros, estatus, progreso visible y superar retos.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 rounded-lg">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400 block mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-compass mr-1"></i> EXPLORER (Explorador)</span>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-300">Motivado por descubrir secretos, mapear áreas, descubrir lore e interactuar con el sistema.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 rounded-lg">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-cyan-400 block mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-comments mr-1"></i> SOCIALIZER (Socializador)</span>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-300">Motivado por relaciones, trabajo en equipo, emotes, guilds y comunidades.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/20 rounded-lg">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-rose-400 block mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-skull mr-1"></i> KILLER (Predador)</span>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-300">Motivado por dominar sobre otros, PvP, infundir miedo o influir drásticamente en el entorno.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Form -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                    <div class="space-y-4">
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1">Nombre del Archotipo / Persona</label>
                            <input type="text" id="persona-name" placeholder="Ej: 'El Explorador Meticuloso' o 'El Competitivo Hardcore'" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500">
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1">Tipo Primario de Bartle</label>
                            <select id="persona-bartle-primary" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500">
                                <option value="">Selecciona el dominante...</option>
                                <option value="Achiever">Achiever (Triunfador)</option>
                                <option value="Explorer">Explorer (Explorador)</option>
                                <option value="Socializer">Socializer (Socializador)</option>
                                <option value="Killer">Killer (Predador)</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1">Tipo Secundario de Bartle</label>
                            <select id="persona-bartle-secondary" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500">
                                <option value="">Selecciona el secundario...</option>
                                <option value="Achiever">Achiever (Triunfador)</option>
                                <option value="Explorer">Explorer (Explorador)</option>
                                <option value="Socializer">Socializer (Socializador)</option>
                                <option value="Killer">Killer (Predador)</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-4">
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1">Frustraciones y Puntos de Dolor del Jugador</label>
                            <textarea id="persona-frustrations" rows="3" placeholder="¿Qué arruinaría la experiencia de este perfil de jugador en este juego?" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500"></textarea>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1">Drivers Motivacionales Principal</label>
                            <textarea id="persona-motivations" rows="3" placeholder="¿Qué hace que este jugador continúe jugando a la 3ª hora consecutiva?" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500"></textarea>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex justify-between pt-4 border-t border-slate-800">
                    <button onclick="goToStep(1)" class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 text-sm font-semibold rounded-xl transition">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left mr-2"></i> Anterior
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="goToStep(3)" class="px-6 py-3 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl shadow-lg transition flex items-center space-x-2">
                        <span>Siguiente: Gamification Model Canvas</span>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- STEP 3: GAMIFICATION MODEL CANVAS -->
        <section id="step-3" class="hidden space-y-6">
            <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-slate-800 space-y-6">
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-4 gap-4">
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-cubes-stacked mr-3 text-indigo-400"></i> 3. Gamification Model Canvas (GMC)
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Diseña la arquitectura del bucle motivacional del juego para el cliente.</p>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Fase 3 de 4</span>
                </div>

                <!-- Canvas Grid Simulation -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                    <!-- Column 1: Core Objectives & Aesthetics -->
                    <div class="bg-slate-900/90 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 space-y-4">
                        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye mr-2"></i> Objetivos y Estética
                        </h4>
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-[11px] text-slate-400 mb-1">Objetivo del Jugador (Win Condition)</label>
                            <input type="text" id="gmc-objective" placeholder="Ej. Sobrevivir 5 noches / Vencer al Jefe" class="w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs text-white">
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-[11px] text-slate-400 mb-1">Sensación/Estética Predominante</label>
                            <input type="text" id="gmc-aesthetic" placeholder="Ej. Klaustrofobia, Fantasía Melancólica" class="w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs text-white">
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Column 2: Mechanics & Dynamics -->
                    <div class="bg-slate-900/90 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 space-y-4">
                        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-gears mr-2"></i> Dinámicas y Mecánicas (MDA)
                        </h4>
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-[11px] text-slate-400 mb-1">Mecánicas de Entrada / Trigger</label>
                            <input type="text" id="gmc-triggers" placeholder="Ej. Sonido en el pasillo, barra de oxígeno" class="w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs text-white">
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-[11px] text-slate-400 mb-1">Mecánicas de Respuesta / Acción</label>
                            <input type="text" id="gmc-actions" placeholder="Ej. Cerrar puerta, Parry, Recolectar madera" class="w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs text-white">
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Column 3: Feedback & Rewards -->
                    <div class="bg-slate-900/90 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 space-y-4">
                        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-award mr-2"></i> Feedback & Recompensas (SAPS)
                        </h4>
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-[11px] text-slate-400 mb-1">Feedback Visual / Auditivo Inmediato</label>
